  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "According to the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\n**Option 1 :** 8 and 14\n\nGiven:\n\n5 × 40 ÷ 8 + 3 – 14 = 53\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n5 × **__40 ÷ 14__** + 3 – 8 = 53\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n__**5 × 2.85**__ + 3 – 8 = 53\n\n__**14.28 + 3**__ – 8 = 53\n\n**__17.28 – 8__** = 53\n\n9.28 = 53** (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 2 : **5 and 3\n\n**Given:**\n\n5 × 40 ÷ 8 + 3 – 14 = 53\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n3 × **__40 ÷ 8__** + 5 – 14 = 53\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n**__3 × 5__** + 5 – 14 = 53\n\n**__15 + 5__** – 14 = 53\n\n**__20 – 14__** = 53\n\n6 = 53** (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 3 :** **5 and 8**\n\n**Given:**\n\n**5 × 40 ÷ 8 + 3 – 14 = 53**\n\n**After interchange the signs;**\n\n**8 × __40 ÷ 5__ + 3 – 14 = 53**\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n**__8 × 8__ + 3 – 14 = 53**\n\n**__64 + 3__ – 14 = 53**\n\n**__67 – 14__ = 53**\n\n**53 = 53 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n**Option 4 :** 8 and 3\n\nGiven:\n\n5 × 40 ÷ 8 + 3 – 14 = 53\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n5 × **__40 ÷ 3__** + 8 – 14 = 53\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n**__5 × 13.4__** + 8 – 14 = 53\n\n**__66.7 + 8__** – 14 = 53\n\n**__74.7 – 14__** = 53\n\n60.7 = 53 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, the answer is **“****5 and 8”.**",
